OL,3,GNEWSAPlane and ferry disruption caused
OL,4,Aby high winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British Airways flight which briefly
OL,7,Ftouched down in Guernsey was forced to
OL,8,Freturn to London Heathrow Airport with
OL,9,Fall the passengers still on board as
OL,10,Fhigh winds caused travel chaos over the
OL,11,Fweekend.
OL,13,FTravel disruption continued on Saturday
OL,14,Fafter Storm Austen hit the Channel
OL,15,FIslands on Friday, with flights
OL,16,Fcancelled and a ferry held at sea for a
OL,17,Fnumber of hours.
OL,19,FGuernsey Ports said passengers could
OL,20,Fnot be disembarked from the plane
OL,21,Fsafely as "the wind conditions exceeded
OL,22,Fsafe limits" for the steps required.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
