OL,3,GNEWSAPlane and ferry disruption caused
OL,4,Aby high winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the aircraft returned to
OL,7,FHeathrow "with the 26 passengers on
OL,8,Fboard" and all other flights on
OL,9,FSaturday afternoon were cancelled.
